      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in immense pain, and the idea of them being free from your presence feels like the only possible relief right now. Please know that feeling like you are a burden is a sign of deep suffering, not a factual statement about your value. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to a crisis line immediately by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada. There are people who want to support you through this overwhelming moment.",
